  "description": "Brophy Estates are delighted to present 17 Galtrim Grange to the market — a beautifully positioned three-bedroom end-of-terrace family home located within a highly sought-after residential development. Positioned in a quiet secluded estate within walking distance of Malahide Dart, Village and Castle.\n\nThis bright and well-maintained property offers spacious accommodation throughout and is ideally suited to modern family living, with views towards the park to the rear of the property. \n\nThe ground floor briefly comprises a welcoming living room with feature fireplace and double doors leading to an open-plan kitchen/dining area, creating an ideal space for both everyday living and entertaining. The kitchen is fitted with an excellent range of floor and wall units providing ample storage and workspace.\n\nAn insulated sunroom located off the kitchen/dining area adds valuable additional living space and overlooks the private south-west facing rear garden. Access leads to a paved patio area, perfect for outdoor dining and enjoying the sunny aspect.\n\nThere is a downstairs shower room for added convenience. \n\nUpstairs, the property offers three well-proportioned bedrooms together with a family bathroom, while a convenient guest WC/shower room is located on the ground floor. Electic stira stairs provide convenient access to the attic offering additional storage space.\n\nCar parking spaces for two cars to the front of the property. \n\nGaltrim Grange is ideally situated close to a host of local amenities including schools, shops, cafés, restaurants, and excellent transport links. Malahide Village, the DART station, and Dublin Airport are all within easy reach, making this an ideal home for families and commuters alike. \n\nThere is a bus stop at the entrance to Galtrim Grange with routes to City Centre, UCD and DCU. \n\nWithin walking distance of Malahide Community School and several National Schools.\n\nAccommodation :\n \nFoyer : 2.47m x 4.65m\n\nLiving Room : 3.62m x 5.19m\n\nDining Area : 2.50m x 2.59 – leading to Sun Room \n\nKitchen : 3.72m x 2.59m – leading to south west facing rear garden \n\nSun Room : 2.49m x 2.71m\n\nMain Bedroom : 3.81m x 3.83m\n\nBedroom 2 : 3.79m x 3.06m\n\nBedroom 3 : 2.92m x 2.66m\n\nMain Bathroom : 2.80m x 1.66m",
